---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="How by3DXYZ handles visit, order, and email data. No customer accounts on this site.">
  <section class="wrap page-hero prose">
    <p class="kicker">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>
      This page explains what the shop collects when you visit, write, or pay. There are no customer accounts on this
      site.
    </p>
    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      If you use the contact form, the shop receives your name, email, and message at {site.email}. Custom requests on
      the <a href="/custom">custom page</a>, print-a-file requests on the
      <a href="/print">print page</a>, and paid-order notices after checkout, are emailed to the shop.
    </p>
    <h2>Checkout</h2>
    <p>
      Payments on this site go through PayPal. Card details are handled by PayPal, not by our servers. After payment,
      the shop receives each SKU, selected options, quantity, the total, and the ship-to address PayPal collected, so
      the order can be printed and mailed. See PayPal’s privacy policy for details.
    </p>
    <p>
      Purchases on Etsy follow Etsy’s policies: <a href={site.etsyUrl}>{site.etsyUrl}</a>
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and ads</h2>
    <p>
      PayPal may set cookies on its checkout page. This site keeps the cart in session storage on your device, not in
      a shop cookie, and it does not run ads.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Shop questions: {site.email}</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
